invariant: INV-62
file: mldsa_sign_pack.c
catches: mldsa_signer_test
reason: the range check of s1 and s2 accepts every 3-bit value, so a key
  whose s1 or s2 skDecode decodes out of [-2, 2] signs.
  bin/mldsa_signer_test requires a refusal for a key with a value of 5,
  and a verdict of 0 for a packed value of 5 at the edge.

--- old
    return over ^ 1U;
--- new
    (void)over;
    return 1U;
